title AVG-08 Update AVG First, Then Publish Listing and Mirror · PRD 2.14 · US-16
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant AVG
participant Zetrix_HSM
participant Sync_Queue
participant Zetrix_Registry
participant OpenAgenet_Registrar
==SYNC LISTING==
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:update service status first (order safety)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Sync_Queue:listing event (create / new version / hide / show / remove)
Sync_Queue->Zetrix_Registry:apply (source of truth, within 60 s)
Zetrix_Registry-->Sync_Queue:ok
Sync_Queue->Sync_Queue:build did:oan DID document (keys, endpoint, oanMetadata)
Sync_Queue->Zetrix_HSM:sign with service did:oan key (Zetrix is controller)
Zetrix_HSM-->Sync_Queue:proof
Sync_Queue->OpenAgenet_Registrar:submit package / status (API TBC with CAICT)
OpenAgenet_Registrar-->Sync_Queue:accepted
Sync_Queue-->Admin_Portal_Backend:registry SYNCED, mirror SYNCED
alt REGISTRY OR MIRROR CALL FAILS
Sync_Queue->Sync_Queue:retry after 1, 5, 15 min
Sync_Queue-->Admin_Portal_Backend:SYNC_FAILED shown in portal, manual Retry (no email; mirror failure never changes Zetrix listing)
end
